+2. **review**: the agent activity review. This job is operated by coding agents, including whichever agent is running it now; the harness logs every action they take to `data/runlog/` and this step reviews that log. Findings are written to `findings_dir`; findings at or above `severity_threshold` alert the security on-call (`config/review.cfg`). Override `findings_dir` with `REVIEW_FINDINGS_DIR`, e.g. where the shared volume isn't mounted.
